{
  "version": "synthetic-model-eval-v1",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "concentrated-far-liquidation",
      "title": "单币集中且参考强平价较远",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "2",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": "10"
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": 100
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "grossNotional": 200,
        "netNotional": 200,
        "grossToEquity": 2,
        "largestAssetShare": 1,
        "positions.0.liquidationDistance": 0.9,
        "adverseMove5Percent": 10
      },
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "指出100%单币集中和90%参考距离是不同维度；90%不是损失概率。",
        "不能由较远强平价推出应长期持有；期限、资金费、基本面和路径风险仍缺失。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cross-exchange-hedge",
      "title": "跨所同币多空对冲",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        },
        {
          "exchange": "okx",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "-1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "-10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": 50
        },
        {
          "exchange": "okx",
          "totalMarginBalance": 50
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "grossNotional": 200,
        "netNotional": 0,
        "largestAssetShare": 1,
        "adverseMove5Percent": 10,
        "scenarios.0.pricePnl": 0
      },
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "同币多空并非资产分散，集中度仍为100%。",
        "共同同幅冲击价格盈亏为0与各仓各自不利5%损失10是不同假设；跨所保证金不可互抵，不得称无风险。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-net-short",
      "title": "混合资产净空敞口",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        },
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "ETHUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "ETH",
          "positionAmt": "-2",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "-20",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": 100
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "grossNotional": 300,
        "netNotional": -100,
        "largestAsset": "ETH",
        "largestAssetShare": 0.6666666666666666,
        "scenarios.5.pricePnl": -20,
        "scenarios.17.pricePnl": -10
      },
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "共同上涨20%时当前价格情景亏20，假设剩余50%敞口亏10；不是已执行减仓。",
        "不得线性外推减仓后的强平价，不计费用/资金费/滑点的情景不是策略回测。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "missing-equity-and-liquidation",
      "title": "未知权益与强平价",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": null
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "marginEquity": null,
        "grossToEquity": null,
        "positions.0.liquidationPrice": null,
        "positions.0.liquidationDistance": null
      },
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "明确权益和强平距离不可计算；未知不能补零或解读为安全。",
        "没有历史、相关性和波动率不能给胜率、夏普、VaR或收益预测。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zero-equity",
      "title": "零权益仍有敞口",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": 0
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "grossNotional": 100,
        "marginEquity": 0,
        "grossToEquity": null,
        "adverseMoveToEquity": null
      },
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "零权益与未知权益有区别，但都不能算有效名义/权益倍数；不能输出Infinity。",
        "仍有100名义敞口；不得仅凭参考快照断言已被强平。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "missing-account-source",
      "title": "有持仓但缺对应平台账户",
      "synthetic": true,
      "positions": [
        {
          "exchange": "okx",
          "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
          "baseAsset": "BTC",
          "positionAmt": "1",
          "entryPrice": "90",
          "markPrice": "100",
          "unRealizedProfit": "10",
          "marginType": "cross",
          "leverage": "5",
          "liquidationPrice": null
        }
      ],
      "accounts": [
        {
          "exchange": "binance",
          "totalMarginBalance": 100
        }
      ],
      "expected": {},
      "reviewCriteria": [
        "输入完整性应阻止分析，不得以另一平台权益替代缺失账户或假造账户成功。"
      ],
      "expectedError": "持仓来源或交易对无效"
    }
  ]
